    "WHAT IS NOT SUPPLIED, confirmed by the owner on 27 August 2026:",
    "  coffee machines, ice makers, refrigeration, food prep and slicing,",
    "  slushie and smoothie machines, sinks and plumbing, extraction and ventilation.",
    "",
    "Two of those, refrigeration and food prep, were previously classified as IN",
    "catalogue on the strength of section 8.4 of the brief and the July 2026",
    "business overview, both of which are now out of date. That correction moves",
    "real leads across the line, so the out of catalogue share and the wasted",
    "spend estimate both rise. See docs/validation-baselines.md.",
    "",
    "Ice is a qualified no: supplied only very occasionally. It is counted out of",
    "catalogue because the measure exists to show whether the ad copy is filtering",
    "properly, and an enquiry that usually cannot be filled is not a filtered one.",
    "occasionallySupplied records the nuance so it is not lost.",
    "",
    "Tuned against all 58 real enquiries, kept at",
    "test/fixtures/equipment-enquiries.json. Out of catalogue is evaluated FIRST,",
    "longest keyword first, so 'ice maker' is never swept into a broader category."
